# Contact Form Configuration (Optional)
# If neither is set, submitting the form will open the visitor's default email client (mailto fallback).

# Option 1: Formspree (Easiest - just sign up at https://formspree.io and paste your Form ID)
# VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=xpwzabcd

# Option 2: Custom API / Serverless Endpoint URL
# VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://your-domain.example/api/contact
